# Committed build-time config for Cloudflare.
#
# These are safe to commit: the anon key and URL are public by design — they
# ship inside the JS bundle that every user downloads, and RLS is what protects
# the data. The service_role key must NEVER go here or anywhere in the frontend.
#
# NOTE: the URL is the BASE project URL with no path. supabase-js adds
# /rest/v1, /auth/v1 etc. itself — a trailing /rest/v1/ here would double it up.
